    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step Into the Fast-Paced World of Journalism!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Reporter Desk</i>, you take on the role of a rising journalist navigating the dynamic and often chaotic world of news reporting. Armed with a typewriter, a phone, and a camera, you must uncover the truth, chase breaking stories, and build your newspaper empire from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer urgent calls, gather leads, and decide which stories are worth publishing. Will you expose corruption, capture shocking crime scenes, or dive into the city's underground world of gambling and hidden deals? The choice is yours, but every decision shapes your reputation and success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf0 <strong>Immersive Journalism Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Investigate, write, and publish stories that shape the world around you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/5633ab598e6a31246e3bf46c2c1f6193.poster.avif?t=1753873761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/5633ab598e6a31246e3bf46c2c1f6193.webm?t=1753873761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/5633ab598e6a31246e3bf46c2c1f6193.mp4?t=1753873761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Capture the Action</strong> \u2013 Use your camera to document key events, from action scenes to city life. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/d95d535cd5aa74640d4bdecf81df82dc.poster.avif?t=1753873761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/d95d535cd5aa74640d4bdecf81df82dc.webm?t=1753873761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/d95d535cd5aa74640d4bdecf81df82dc.mp4?t=1753873761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udcde <strong>Dynamic Newsroom</strong> \u2013 Answer calls, follow leads, and manage the daily pressure of reporting.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/84ff8e5e7e4df294c0d7bc4e1d8448a3.poster.avif?t=1753873761\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/84ff8e5e7e4df294c0d7bc4e1d8448a3.webm?t=1753873761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/84ff8e5e7e4df294c0d7bc4e1d8448a3.mp4?t=1753873761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Living, Breathing City</strong> \u2013 A world filled with basketball courts, shady bars, and bustling caf\u00e9s, each with its own stories. <br><br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Build Your News Empire</strong> \u2013 Expand your office, hire staff, and increase production to dominate the news industry. <br><br>\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Your Choices Matter</strong> \u2013 Will you chase sensational headlines for quick cash or uphold journalistic integrity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience the highs and lows of investigative journalism in <i>Reporter Desk</i>! Will you be a fearless truth-seeker or a sensationalist chasing the next big headline? The pen\u2014and the camera\u2014are in your hands.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step Into the Fast-Paced World of Journalism!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Reporter Desk</i>, you take on the role of a rising journalist navigating the dynamic and often chaotic world of news reporting. Armed with a typewriter, a phone, and a camera, you must uncover the truth, chase breaking stories, and build your newspaper empire from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer urgent calls, gather leads, and decide which stories are worth publishing. Will you expose corruption, capture shocking crime scenes, or dive into the city's underground world of gambling and hidden deals? The choice is yours, but every decision shapes your reputation and success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf0 <strong>Immersive Journalism Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Investigate, write, and publish stories that shape the world around you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/5633ab598e6a31246e3bf46c2c1f6193.poster.avif?t=1753873761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/5633ab598e6a31246e3bf46c2c1f6193.webm?t=1753873761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/5633ab598e6a31246e3bf46c2c1f6193.mp4?t=1753873761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Capture the Action</strong> \u2013 Use your camera to document key events, from action scenes to city life. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604670/extras/d95d535cd5aa74640d4bdecf81df82dc.poster.avif?t=1753873761\" width=800 height=450 ><source s